--> extract the content.

next step is to make the text machine-readable. for that we aimed to get structured json-files. we pasted the relevant text with the promt 
        "Extract medical information from the text into a JSON array.Strict Rule: Extract ONLY information explicitly stated in the text. Do not add outside medical knowledge.
        Schema:
        disease_name (string)
        symptoms (array of strings)
        causes (array of strings)
        treatments (array of strings) 
        life expectancy (array of strings) 
        outlook (array of strings) 
        diagnosis (array of strings) 
        complications (array of strings)
        prevention (array of strings) 
        living_with(array of strings)
        is_contagious (boolean, or null if unmentioned) 
        You can make it hierachical when sicknesses depend on one another
        "
to make a LLM structure us json formats.

--> for every condition/finding have one file